ust snacks. Anger them at your own peril.","abilities":["While this unit is holding Ammo, periodically summons a <Snack Cart>. Ammo capacity: 3","Deals significantly increased damage to enemies blocking this unit"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":17500,"atk":500,"def":650,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"andoain_the_martyr":{"slug":"andoain_the_martyr","name":"Andoain, the 'Martyr'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Andoain, the 'Martyr'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Sankta who made an enemy of Laterano for the sake of asking a question. A Pathfinder who tread the path of peril for the sake of receiving an answer. He feels neither wrath nor sorrow. He neither curses God, nor beseeches man. Andoain only follows his own path, wherever it may end.","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","While this unit is holding Ammo, ATK increases. Ammo capacity: 5","While this unit is holding Ammo, gains increased ATK and attacks will cause bullets to bounce to nearby targets up to 5 times, dealing additional damage to 'Gelato Stops'","First Form","[Light Unto Sufferers] Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost, creates a permanent field effect. Enemies standing on affected tiles take reduced Physical and Arts damage and gain 50% Physical and Arts dodge","Second Form","After being defeated once, enters his Second Form, gaining increased ATK","[Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust] Andoain stops attacking and scans the battlefield from left to right, locking onto at most 5 targets before dealing massive Physical damage to them and fully replenishing his Ammo","Whenever a low percentage of HP is lost, unleashes the permanent terrain effect [Light Unto Sufferers]"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":27000,"atk":750,"def":550,"res":60,"element